<title>UK: Rolls Royce wins $55 mln BA order.</title>
<headline>Rolls Royce wins $55 mln BA order.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering conglomerate Rolls-Royce Plc said on Friday it had won an engine order from British Airways Plc valued at $55 million.</p>
</text>
